Dear Equinor Ventures Team,

I am Narges Farahani from Parsa International Group, an Istanbul-based compan=
y developing AI software for energy operations. Equinor Ventures' interest in=
 AI and digital solutions for the energy transition led me to write to you.

Our products address:
- Predictive maintenance and digital twins for rotating equipment and process=
 units;
- Real-time monitoring and analytics for oil and gas fields and storage termi=
nals;
- Energy, emissions and carbon management with optimisation of energy use.

The products are advanced prototypes (TRL 4-5) tested on simulated data. We a=
re looking for a first industrial pilot to validate them on real operating da=
ta, and for early-stage funding.

We understand our stage is earlier than most Equinor Ventures investments. Wo=
uld you be open to a short call, or could you point us to the Equinor innovat=
ion or pilot programme that works with companies at our stage?

Best regards,

Narges Farahani
AI Sector
Parsa International Group
Istanbul, T=C3=BCrkiye
